      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Bottega Veneta has just launched the Corso, a brand-new bag from its Fall/Winter 2026 collection. Staying true to the house's signature minimalist, logo-free aesthetic, it pairs Intrecciato-woven lambskin with panels of glossy lambskin across a roomy tote silhouette. The clean lines meet impeccable craftsmanship, resulting in a look that is both elegant and timeless.",
