    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Corso bag features a clean, open-top design, with the house's iconic Intrecciato lambskin weave shaping the square body and glossy lambskin panels at the sides lending a striking sense of suppleness. Inside, the lining is crafted from soft, smooth suede, while the opening is secured with a refined leather hook closure and includes a detachable zipped pouch. The regular size measures 26 cm high x 30 cm wide x 18.5 cm deep.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
