      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Large size measures 29.5 cm high x 34 cm wide x 20.5 cm deep. Its classic Intreccio woven leather balances structured shape with a supple feel, while the glossy lambskin at the sides flares out like a flowing skirt, adding a finer, more delicate touch. Fitted with dual handles, the bag can be carried by hand or worn over the shoulder, making it a great choice for the commute, travel, or as a mom bag. It comes in two colorways: black and deep mahogany.",
