    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Maxi Corso seen on the runway comes in an oversized 34.5 cm high x 38 cm wide x 24.5 cm deep format, making it equally well suited to larger-framed men. Lightweight yet supple, its richly textured woven leather brings a quietly artisanal feel to fall and winter looks, while the extra-large capacity handles everyday needs. You can add your own drawstring insert inside to keep your belongings from spilling out.",
